            },
            "text": {
              "expr": {
                "Literal": {
                  "Value": "'Measures the relative difference between the 95th percentile and median trip distance for each route pair.\n\nFormula: (P95 Trip Distance - Median Trip Distance) / Median Trip Distance × 100%.\n\nOnly route pairs with at least 20 recorded trips are assessed.\n\nHigher values indicate greater variation in the upper end of trip distances. They do not automatically indicate mileage fraud or incorrect travel records.\n\nDifferences may result from alternative routes, additional stops, road conditions, or inconsistent destination descriptions.'"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
